name tikz-ladder
category Package
revision 62992
shortdesc Draw ladder diagrams using TikZ
longdesc The tikz-ladder package contains a collection of symbols for
longdesc typesetting ladder diagrams (PLC program) in agreement with the
longdesc international standard IEC-61131-3/2013. It includes blocks
longdesc (for representing functions and function blocks) besides
longdesc contacts and coils. It extends the circuit library of TikZ and
longdesc allows you to draw a ladder diagram in the same way as you
longdesc would draw any other circuit.
